        "created_at": "2017-04-22T11:55:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nothing new indeed, but it was nice getting to hear Christopher talk about both the history of GTG and all those games in one place. I mean, usually, games discussion is spread out across multiple threads, y'know? :)</p>",
