        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-22T12:23:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would argue that there was new \"revealations\", that of how the game is supposed to play. That the game is not neccessarily designed to be balanced* everytime you play it, but that it's designed to convey a certain experience, I'm not sure I've ever heard that explicitly stated before.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Balanced is the wrong word but I can't think of a better one.</p>",
